le_name": "frigate_2560x1440_2021-07-17_10-29-03.png", "id": "176465251179168", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_176465254512501_4671886878290832354_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6xsRc46dWa4Q7kNvwFUpX4F&_nc_oc=AdqGMCrl49FMwkWNnk-uyX3qRzmKbOi7lPjp47p9KZTJPGpQjkFLtwWpo36BR08lk9w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTrzO_C_LAqsqeiidSsGXdDVA-eEFwCtuNmkyIPlFAysA&oe=6B032E7D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "title_2560x1440_2021-07-15_14-43-19.png", "id": "373849930858399", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974813_373849934191732_5524922920908616826_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X_aIbky8cbAQ7kNvwHezMhJ&_nc_oc=AdpGv4LY2AedvEPe-THFZyH7TEMab61sWG8xykzioOSsElY9oltvnQCk_aWUSUZifho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR0JYnNpGt3D-4MIf1mu6L9VmuX7Xgp9QENwpzWsVdrsQ&oe=6B030E9C"}, "display_name": "Starfighter Arduxim", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Strap into the cockpit of your Arduxim starfighter and take on enemy starships in this first-person tactical space shooter. Navigate through dangerous ice crystal fields, travel through hyper gates to other systems, take on enormous capital ships and more.\n\nControl your ship using Touch controllers, a gamepad, or hand tracking. Players can use the thumb sticks on a physical controller, or for a more immersive experience grab virtual cockpit controls using the Touch controllers or your bare hands.\n\nIncludes:\n* A fourteen mission story based campaign covering your first tour of duty on the front lines\n* Multiplayer to test your skills against other pilots\n* Survival/horde challenge mode with online leader board\n* Tutorial\n* Practice mode", "short_description": "Strap into the cockpit of your Arduxim starfighter and take on enemy starships in this first-person tactical space shoot